WEBVTT

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:04.766
Everyone signs in with <b>their own email and password</b>

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.422
And goes straight to the register

00:00:07.526 --> 00:00:12.917
At the end of the shift, <b>sign out</b> from your account menu

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:17.606
Forgot your password? Tap <b>¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</b> (forgot your password?)

00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:23.505
Type your email and you get a link to create a new one
